{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lone Pine is a single-player, 2D adventure  set in the fictional Lone Pine National Park.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Izzie, a young outdoors buff and aspiring photographer, who has travelled to Lone Pine to attempt to gather evidence of 'cryptids' - mythical creatures whose very existence is disputed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a raging storm hits, and Izzie discovers that not all on the mountain is as it seems, explore, climb, solve puzzles, uncover mysteries, and create the path forward to find your way home. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575850/extras/f24246485cb8e39740ee1a75be461133.poster.avif?t=1759709074\" width=616 height=411 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575850/extras/f24246485cb8e39740ee1a75be461133.webm?t=1759709074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncover the mystery of Lone Pine</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by real-world folklore and mythology, use context-sensitive interactions and puzzles to separate fact from fiction in this strange, forgotten place. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575850/extras/6d02c0692f5bef61c3fb079fdb93bcfe.poster.avif?t=1759709074\" width=616 height=411 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575850/extras/6d02c0692f5bef61c3fb079fdb93bcfe.webm?t=1759709074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore and discover</strong>\u2028\u2028 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Izzie\u2019s camera to capture evidence of cryptids. Learn to master exposure and timing to get the perfect shot, and name your discoveries as your reward. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575850/extras/c949cd4ca0dc52ebcca85366c2b8fb51.poster.avif?t=1759709074\" width=616 height=411 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575850/extras/c949cd4ca0dc52ebcca85366c2b8fb51.webm?t=1759709074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shape the Story</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring fully voice-acted characters and a radio mechanic with dynamic branching dialogue. Your choices matter in this narrative adventure, with two endings based on player choices. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575850/extras/16670c11835a2ca6b0a4db34b038382f.poster.avif?t=1759709074\" width=616 height=411 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575850/extras/16670c11835a2ca6b0a4db34b038382f.webm?t=1759709074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Izzie\u2019s story, and decide how she deals with the past, present, and future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575850/extras/147042abec8b1770a63a3041737f9de8.poster.avif?t=1759709074\" width=616 height=411 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575850/extras/147042abec8b1770a63a3041737f9de8.webm?t=1759709074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3575850?t=1759709074","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575850/66384a5c16d81fe50277442a66358cd98ebb8060/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759709074","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575850/b101b2e7a46f9843a20ec6791ecce21546ff59ed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759709074","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575850/b101b2e7a46f9843a20ec6791ecce21546ff59ed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759709074","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lone Pine is a single-player, 2D adventure  set in the fictional Lone Pine National Park.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Izzie, a young outdoors buff and aspiring photographer, who has travelled to Lone Pine to attempt to gather evidence of 'cryptids' - mythical creatures whose very existence is disputed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a raging storm hits, and Izzie discovers that not all on the mountain is as it seems, explore, climb, solve puzzles, uncover mysteries, and create the path forward to find y